{
  "description": "polish / proofread 输出切分用例。Rust split_edit_output 与 TS splitEditOutput 共用，TS 只读引用。规则：先把 \\r\\n 规范为 \\n（返回的正文与改动都是规范化之后的文本）；找最后一个 \\n---\\n（输出以 \\n--- 结尾也算，此时改动为空）；分隔线之后 trim 的内容（可带 ** 加粗）以「改动」或 Changes（大小写不敏感）开头才切分，否则整段都是正文；切分时正文去掉末尾空白，改动 trim，改动为空时为 null。",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "basic",
      "input": "Thanks for the review. I've fixed the issues you mentioned.\n\n---\n改动：补上冠词，修正时态。",
      "body": "Thanks for the review. I've fixed the issues you mentioned.",
      "changes": "改动：补上冠词，修正时态。"
    },
    {
      "name": "last separator wins",
      "input": "A\n---\nB\n---\n改动：x",
      "body": "A\n---\nB",
      "changes": "改动：x"
    },
    {
      "name": "no separator",
      "input": "Just the edited text.",
      "body": "Just the edited text.",
      "changes": null
    },
    {
      "name": "unchanged text",
      "input": "这个功能明天上线。\n\n---\n改动：无",
      "body": "这个功能明天上线。",
      "changes": "改动：无"
    },
    {
      "name": "markdown rule in body without changes line",
      "input": "Part 1\n---\nPart 2",
      "body": "Part 1\n---\nPart 2",
      "changes": null
    },
    {
      "name": "markdown rule in body with changes line",
      "input": "# Title\n\n---\n\nText\n\n---\n改动：润色措辞",
      "body": "# Title\n\n---\n\nText",
      "changes": "改动：润色措辞"
    },
    {
      "name": "bold changes label",
      "input": "Body\n\n---\n**改动**：去掉冗余的「进行」",
      "body": "Body",
      "changes": "**改动**：去掉冗余的「进行」"
    },
    {
      "name": "english changes label",
      "input": "Body\n---\nChanges: fixed a typo",
      "body": "Body",
      "changes": "Changes: fixed a typo"
    },
    {
      "name": "multi-line changes",
      "input": "Body\n---\n改动：第一处。\n第二处。",
      "body": "Body",
      "changes": "改动：第一处。\n第二处。"
    },
    {
      "name": "trailing whitespace is trimmed",
      "input": "Body  \n\n---\n改动：x  \n",
      "body": "Body",
      "changes": "改动：x"
    },
    {
      "name": "dangling separator at end",
      "input": "Body\n\n---",
      "body": "Body",
      "changes": null
    },
    {
      "name": "dangling separator with trailing newline",
      "input": "Body\n---\n",
      "body": "Body",
      "changes": null
    },
    {
      "name": "separator at the very start",
      "input": "\n---\n改动：无",
      "body": "",
      "changes": "改动：无"
    },
    {
      "name": "separator without leading newline is not a separator",
      "input": "---\n改动：无",
      "body": "---\n改动：无",
      "changes": null
    },
    {
      "name": "longer dash line is not a separator",
      "input": "Body\n----\n改动：x",
      "body": "Body\n----\n改动：x",
      "changes": null
    },
    {
      "name": "crlf line endings",
      "input": "Body\r\n\r\n---\r\n改动：无",
      "body": "Body",
      "changes": "改动：无"
    },
    {
      "name": "crlf multi-line changes",
      "input": "Line 1\r\nLine 2\r\n---\r\nChanges: a\r\nb\r\n",
      "body": "Line 1\nLine 2",
      "changes": "Changes: a\nb"
    },
    {
      "name": "crlf without separator is normalized",
      "input": "A\r\nB",
      "body": "A\nB",
      "changes": null
    },
    {
      "name": "empty",
      "input": "",
      "body": "",
      "changes": null
    }
  ]
}
